    "query": "{ streams(first:30) { edges { cursor node { id title viewersCount contentClassificationLabels { id localizedName } broadcaster { login displayName broadcastSettings { isMature title } } } } } }",
    "why": "Locks the two field names the Twitch signal depends on: Stream.contentClassificationLabels[].id and broadcastSettings.isMature. If Twitch renames either, this fixture stops stripping and the test fails loudly instead of the filter going quietly dead.",
