      "ProfanityVulgarity": "Significant Profanity or Vulgarity"
    },
    "note_on_sexual_themes": "SexualThemes is a real id in Twitch's published label set, but logged-out clients cannot see streams carrying it (the Pools/Hot-Tubs category returns zero edges), so no live sample could be captured. The `synthetic_sexual` block below is hand-built on the VERIFIED shape of a captured edge, with only the label id swapped. Re-capture it from a logged-in session when one is available."
  },

